<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Solicitud enviada correctamente a Limpama." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" sizes="512x512" href="/palmeras-512.webp" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>Solicitud enviada | Limpama</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="confirmation" aria-labelledby="confirmation-title">
        <a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="Volver al inicio de Limpama">
          <img src="/logoLimpama.webp" alt="" />
          <span>Limpama</span>
        </a>
        <div class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Mensaje recibido</p>
        <h1 id="confirmation-title">Solicitud enviada correctamente</h1>
        <p>Gracias por contactar con nosotros. Revisaremos tu solicitud y te responderemos lo antes posible.</p>
        <a class="button" href="/">Volver a la página principal <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root { --pine: #143d36; --paper: #f5f7f2; --lime: #a6da78; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; color: var(--pine); background: var(--paper); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  main { min-height: 100svh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 32px 20px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 15%, rgba(112, 208, 195, .2), transparent 34%); }
  .confirmation { width: min(680px, 100%); padding: clamp(32px, 7vw, 70px); text-align: center; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72); border: 1px solid rgba(20, 61, 54, .14); border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(20, 61, 54, .1); }
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 44px; color: var(--pine); font: 800 22px/1 'Manrope', sans-serif; text-decoration: none; }
  .logo img { width: 42px; height: 42px; object-fit: contain; }
  .check { width: 76px; height: 76px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 0 auto 24px; color: var(--pine); background: var(--lime); border-radius: 50%; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #56851f; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 18px; font: 700 clamp(32px, 6vw, 52px)/1.08 'Manrope', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; color: #426259; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .button { min-height: 54px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; margin-top: 32px; padding: 0 22px; color: var(--pine); background: var(--lime); border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
  .button span { font-size: 22px; }
  .button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--pine); outline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
